<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market - April 24.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market - April 24.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following Brazilian soybean and products basis levels.</p>
<p>(NB-no buyer NS-no seller T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	BASIS	 MONTH	  PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	   24/20 D     April	  24/20 D</p>
<p> May	     20/18 D     May	    20/18 D</p>
<p> July		8/5 D     July	     8/5 D</p>
<p> August	  20/23 P     August	 20/23 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT    BASIS	 MONTH	PREV</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	     NB/NS     April	    NB/NS</p>
<p> May	    110/80 D     May	   110/80 D</p>
<p> July	  140/120 D     July	 140/120 D</p>
<p> August	 120/90 D     August	120/90 D</p>
